_": "713329593", "pk": "713329593", "pk_id": "713329593", "id": "713329593", "username": "rss.mtt", "full_name": "Mattia Rossi 🌊", "is_private": false, "is_verified": false, "profile_pic_id": "3669299857290781556_713329593", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/514862270_18516205495049594_8556620336802317856_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFDHWtI_i1_DmPya29_3ClTArWhe5v4NJtc7jbe94TWv1yMnn6JygOKI3rSl30d6-g&_nc_ohc=ggic0EBBPvcQ7kNvwG-aPPq&_nc_gid=omfPLkqMJnYxW3nhm1L4rg&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af_WNIKNWZ57Gde6j1mn-GmTkwt8z3LwxDUc-S3BO7C3Ag&oe=6A266925&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}], "hidden_likes_string_variant": -1, "caption": {"strong_id__": "17970561914779871", "bit_flags": 0, "created_at": 1755251707, "created_at_utc": 1755251707, "did_report_as_spam": false, "is_ranked_comment": false, "pk": "17970561914779871", "share_enabled": false, "content_type": "comment", "media_id": "3699641537772501449", "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "15526265", "has_translation": true, "text": "Allora ieri notte ci siamo chiesti come facessero a svegliarsi prima delle sveglie e abbiamo scoperto che esisteva una figura specifica deputata a questo servizio ovvero il knocker-up: praticamente il bro andava di finestra in finestra a svegliare le persone bussando con un bastone di bambù oppure lanciando piselli secchi con la cerbottana. Ma come tutti sappiamo da nuove risposte nascono nuove domande e quindi il punto è: chi svegliava il bro che doveva svegliare tutti? È nato prima il bro o la gallina? Esistono ancora le mezze stagioni? Etc etc", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFDHWtI_i1_DmPya29_3ClTArWhe5v4NJtc7jbe94TWv1yMnn6JygOKI3rSl30d6-g&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=omfPLkqMJnYxW3nhm1L4rg&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af_EtteQaQPWk-56oi7M1dnZjYfQJiSe3eMehJF_mtA1qg&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "So last night we wondered how they woke up before alarms and we found out that there was a specific figure in this service, aka the knocker-up: basically bro would go from window to window to wake people up by knocking with a bamboo stick or throwing dried peas with the headband. But as we all know, new questions arise from new answers, and so the point is: who woke the bro who was supposed to wake everyone up? Which was born first, the bro or the chicken? Are half seasons still a thing? Etc etc"}, "comment_count": 82, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "feed_post_reshare_disabled": false, "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "third_party_downloads_enabled": 2, "eligible_for_text_app_activation_badge": false, "account_type": 3, "can_see_quiet_post_attribution": true, "account_badges": [], "full_name": "Camihawke", "has_anonymous_profile_picture": false, "is_favorite": false, "is_private": false, "is_ring_creator": false, "show_ring_award": false, "is_verified": true, "show_account_transparency_details": true, "transparency_product_enabled": false, "username": "camihawke", "user_activation_info": {}, "fan_club_info": {"autosave_to_exclusive_highlight": null, "co